          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP247 Egremont&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With all the canola in bloom, this BCP isn't as easy to find as it would be in other seasons.  We had to get the right angle on it so it could be seen!  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_wink.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;   That's different!!  We've never seen anything like that before in ditches.  Thanks, outforthehunt, for showing us this variety (and size) of marker!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
