          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP247 Egremont

Boy if they were all this easy... just think no digging or scratching, no metal detector or compass, etc. But then it would not fun or educational. ..

Email with info sent.

T4TBCP

TeamDJM (8102)

Lethbridge Alberta&lt;/p&gt;

