          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP247 - Egremont&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heading home from Cold Lake after the SRT mega I figured I'd hit as many caps as i could on the way home. As i'm pulling up to this one, i try to pop up the hint ... err ... no hint! WTF?? upon reaching GZ I figured out why :) muah  I've seen these before but not as a cap cache.&lt;/p&gt;

